<title>USA: Mahwah Twp BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Mahwah Twp BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $13.612 million of Mahwah Township Board of Education, N.J., school district bonds, with a lowest rate of 5.10, highest price of 100.2834.</p>
</text>
